       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. The dose is double the usual maximum for oral ibuprofen.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily = **6400 mg/day**\n- **Usual maximum:** 3200 mg/day (prescribing information for oral ibuprofen)\n- **Common regimens:** 400\u2013800 mg every 6\u20138 hours, with 800 mg four times daily (3200 mg/day) as the top of the range\n\nEven with normal kidney and liver function and no allergies, 6400 mg/day raises the risk of GI bleeding, renal injury, and cardiovascular events. Please confirm which you intend:\n\n1. **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n2. **1600 mg by mouth every 8 hours**, which is also 4800 mg/day and still above the maximum, so I don't recommend it\n3. **Another dose or frequency** you specify\n4. **1600 mg four times daily as written**, if you have a clinical reason to exceed the usual maximum. I can enter it with a note documenting that reason.\n\nTell me which option you want and I'll enter it."
      }
